      en: ["The Santa Fe Mega Farm was officially launched in 2012.", "Primary crops produced include rice, soybeans, and corn.", "The project operates on a concession spanning about 29,000 acres.", "Irrigation is facilitated by advanced pumping from the Rupununi River.", "The farm employs a large-scale solar array for its energy needs.", "Harvested products are exported via the road link to Lethem and Brazil."],
